  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kurseong Integrated Water Mgmt</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kurseong Vattenresurshantering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att utveckla ett integrerat                 vattenf&#xf6;rvalningssystem f&#xf6;r omr&#xe5;det Kurseong. Syftet &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka       kommunens kunskap i att planera f&#xf6;r infrastruktur och utveckla        beredskap f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbara infrastrukturella investeringar i              vattenf&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to strengthen the Sweden-India cooperation by        jointly develop an integrated water management system thru local &amp;    regional measures in and around Kurseong. The project aims to         increase the capacity of the Municipality of Kurseong to plan for     infrastructure and sustainable infrastructural investments.</narrative>
  </description>
